 ('ENT_BAH_BAB','PER_BAHAI','1819-1850; herald-Manifestation who declared his mission in 1844 (start of the Bahá''í era) and prophesied ''Him Whom God shall make manifest.'' Historically attested; Smith (2008); Shoghi Effendi, God Passes By.'),
 ('ENT_BAH_BAHAULLAH','PER_BAHAI','1817-1892; central figure and founder of the Bahá''í Faith, ''Him Whom God shall make manifest,'' author of the Kitáb-i-Aqdas and Kitáb-i-Íqán. Historically attested; Smith (2008).'),
 ('ENT_BAH_ABDULBAHA','PER_BAHAI','1844-1921; eldest son of Bahá''u''lláh, appointed Centre of the Covenant and authorized interpreter; not regarded as a Manifestation. Historically attested; Smith (2008).'),
